# Code-only public repository policy
#
# MIMIC-IV and every derived dataset or analysis output stay local. The broad
# rules below are intentional: this repository publishes source code only.

# Restricted or derived data and generated outputs
data/
results/
outputs/
figures/
rendered_sql/
